{
  "name": "Sync Inventario (Google Sheets -> PostgreSQL)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "inventario",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "event": "anyUpdate",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-trigger-change",
      "name": "Trigger - Cambio Inventario",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheetsTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-680, 220],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsTriggerOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEETS_CRED_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets Trigger account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "node-trigger-manual",
      "name": "Primera Carga (Manual)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-680, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "inventario",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-read-inv-sheets",
      "name": "Leer Inventario (Sheets)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [-420, 320],
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEETS_CRED_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "INSERT INTO inventario (id, producto, valor, descripcion, imagenes)\nVALUES ($1, $2, $3, $4, $5)\nON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET\n  producto = EXCLUDED.producto,\n  valor = EXCLUDED.valor,\n  descripcion = EXCLUDED.descripcion,\n  imagenes = EXCLUDED.imagenes;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [$json.id, $json.producto, Number($json.valor) || 0, $json.descripcion || '', $json.imagenes || ''] }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "node-upsert-inv",
      "name": "Upsert Inventario",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [-180, 320],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "YOUR_POSTGRES_CRED_ID",
          "name": "Postgres account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "DELETE FROM inventario WHERE NOT (id = ANY($1::text[]));",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ $('Leer Inventario (Sheets)').all().map(i => String(i.json.id)) ] }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "node-delete-stale",
      "name": "Eliminar Borrados",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [60, 320],
      "executeOnce": true,
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "YOUR_POSTGRES_CRED_ID",
          "name": "Postgres account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sincronizacion de Inventario\n\nEste workflow copia el catalogo de **Google Sheets -> PostgreSQL** SOLO cuando el inventario cambia (Trigger de Google Sheets, evento `anyUpdate`) o al ejecutarlo manualmente la primera vez.\n\nAsi el flujo principal lee el catalogo desde Postgres (rapido) y NO consulta Sheets en cada mensaje.\n\n- **Upsert**: agrega/actualiza productos por `id`.\n- **Eliminar Borrados**: quita de Postgres los productos que ya no estan en la hoja.\n\n**Recuerda** reemplazar `YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID` y las credenciales.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "node-sticky-sync",
      "name": "Notas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-680, -120]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Trigger - Cambio Inventario": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Leer Inventario (Sheets)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Primera Carga (Manual)": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Leer Inventario (Sheets)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Leer Inventario (Sheets)": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Upsert Inventario", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Upsert Inventario": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Eliminar Borrados", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  },
  "tags": []
}
